<h1>About Sengele Ministries</h1>
<p>
	Sengele Ministries exists to bring prayer, teaching and hope to people in need. We focus on prayerful intercession, biblical teaching and practical ministry to help individuals experience spiritual renewal.
</p>

<h3>Our mission</h3>
<p>
	To call people into deeper relationship with God through persistent prayer, clear biblical teaching, and compassionate community service.
</p>

<h3>What we believe</h3>
<p>
	We believe in the power of prayer, the authority of Scripture, and the transformative work of the Holy Spirit in people’s lives. Our services and resources are designed to encourage faith, healing and spiritual growth.
</p>

<p>Content from the original homepage (testimonies, program descriptions and teaching summaries) will be organized into the dedicated pages for Ministries, Messages and Prayer.</p>
